507
01:56:49.246 --> 01:56:50.246
That you have something like this within yourself.

508
01:56:51.246 --> 01:56:52.246
I actually have no touch with Him anymore.

509
01:56:53.246 --> 01:56:57.246
My encouragement is. Just accept Jesus again today.

